o obey a notification to stop received from a person other than the consignor. Definitional Cross References: “Buyer”. Section 2–103. “Contract for sale”. Section 2–106. “Document of title”. Section 1–201. “Goods”. Section 2–105. “Insolvent”. Section 1–201. “Notification”. Section 1–202. “Receipt” of goods. Section 2–103. § 2–705ARTICLE 2. SALES"